  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人工智慧商業應用與創新",
    "sub_ename": "ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE IN BUSINESS APPLICATIONS AND INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將專注於人工智慧（AI）在商業領域的應用，並分析其帶來的創新機會。學生將學習如何將AI技術運用於解決實際商業問題、改善業務流程，以及創造新的商業模式。本課程也會強調AI的未來發展趨勢，以及如何利用這些趨勢捕捉商業機會。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will focus on the application of artificial intelligence (AI) in the business field and analyze the innovation opportunities it brings. Students will learn how to apply AI technology to solve practical business problems, improve business processes, and create new business models. This course will also emphasize the future development trends of AI and how to use these trends to capture business opportunities.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
